      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koreatown%2C_Manhattan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The block between Fifth and Sixth Avenues was officially nicknamed Korea Way by the city, marked with bilingual street signs.",
